	"data": "Cloud Backup Options for Nextcloud (Optiplex)\n\nResearch into cloud backup targets for the self-hosted Nextcloud instance on Optiplex. Covers object storage services, VPS-as-secondary-node approaches, and Nextcloud-specific backup considerations.\n\nCurrent Setup Context\nNextcloud on Optiplex (home network, Tailscale-connected at 100.96.169.9)\nRestic already in use for local backups (cybership target works; elements had NTFS issues)\nOptiplex runs Immich, Forgejo, Caddy, etc.\nStar — main dev…",
